さあさあ、もっと声出せるよねー？
Come on, come on, you can make more noise, right?

206
00:39:25,562 --> 00:39:29,262
じゃあ、一緒に『ジッケンタ！』って叫ぶよー！
Then, let's scream "Jikkenta!" together!

207
00:39:29,562 --> 00:39:32,262
せーの、ジッケンター！
Ready, go, Jikkenta!

208
00:39:38,562 --> 00:39:41,262
もーいっちょ『ジッケンタ』いくよー！
Let's go for "Jikkenta" one more time!

209
00:39:48,062 --> 00:39:50,262
せーの、ジッケンター！
Ready, go, Jikkenta!

210
00:39:50,262 --> 00:39:52,762
ありがとうー！
Thank you!

211
00:39:57,262 --> 00:40:01,062
拙者、風真いろは！いざ尋常に、勝負！
I am Kazama Iroha! Let's have a fair and square duel!

212
00:40:01,082 --> 00:40:02,582
叩き切る！
I'll strike you down!

213
00:40:08,182 --> 00:40:11,582
向う向うの妖精 この歌うたう
The fairy far, far away sings this song,

214
00:40:18,082 --> 00:40:22,082
パートナーの眼になりたい
I want to become the eyes of my partner,

215
00:40:22,082 --> 00:40:26,082
一途続く その前より
even more than before, continuing single-mindedly,

216
00:40:26,082 --> 00:40:30,082
仕切った地に立ちたい
I want to stand on the ground I have conquered,

217
00:40:30,082 --> 00:40:34,082
朽ちる実を芽吹かせる
making the decaying fruit sprout anew.

218
00:40:34,082 --> 00:40:38,082
八百万の雨が降ろうと
Even if the rains of the eight million gods fall,

219
00:40:38,082 --> 00:40:41,582
風向きの進むことなく
without the wind's direction stopping its course,

220
00:40:41,582 --> 00:40:45,582
八百万の声を灯せば
if we light up the voices of the eight million gods...

221
